# Copy to `.env` before the first `vite dev` / `vite build` / `svelte-check`.
#
# Root of the R2 bucket (`arkham-card-images`) that serves `cards.json` and the
# card scans. Without it, `$env/static/public` has no `PUBLIC_CARD_CDN_URL`
# export and `src/lib/server/card-data.ts` fails to type-check and to fetch.
PUBLIC_CARD_CDN_URL="https://assets.arkham-starter.com"
